,{"text":" is asserting who is signed in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"right now","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", not speaking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"for one client. An injected value therefore overrides the login value on every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"client until a login supersedes it.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An injection outlives any one SDK session and is cleared only by the host replacing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it, because only the host knows when its own session changed. A login deliberately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not clear it: with more than one live client (a host’s own session and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"AutoScanManager","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s, say) one client’s login would otherwise wipe an injection that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"belongs to another. A host that logs out injects an empty array, which is honoured."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reads never throw and never block on a lookup: an unknown actor sends "},{"code":"teams: []","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than dropping an MAU-qualifying event over an optional dimension."}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/documentation\/axeDevToolsXCUI\/AxeTeams","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI/documentation/axeDevToolsXCUI/AxeTeams":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxeTeams","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axedevtoolsxcui\/axeteams","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The host-injection channel for the actor’s team memberships, which are stamped onto"},{"type"